    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n    <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"4\">Level 4 - Advanced</span><span class=\"time\">40 min</span>\n    <span class=\"chip bad\">Hard</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Two heaps</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Design</span>\n    <a class=\"chip\" href=\"https://leetcode.com/problems/find-median-from-data-stream/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">LC 295</a>\n  </div>\n  <h1>Find Median from Data Stream</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">Split the stream into a smaller half and a larger half: a max-heap holds the small half, a min-heap the large half, sizes differ by at most one. The median is one or two heap tops. O(log n) per add, O(1) per query.</p>\n"
